FIRESTORM.

1ST PLT, ECHO CO HAS RECEIVED ORDERS FROM BRAVO HQ TO 
ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 117ø SOUTH AND EAST. THIS IS 
A MOP UP OPERATION AGAINST REMNANT CYPRIOT REBEL FORCES. 
MISSION OBJECTIVES ARE TO INCLUDE REMAINING SIGNALS 
INTELLIGENCE/ELECTRONIC WARFARE PLATFORMS. 

YOUR SECONDARY TARGET IS THE REMAINING REBEL FIELD COMMAND 
BASE. BE ADVISED THAT REMAINING CYPRIOT UNITS HAVE ASSUMED 
A DUG IN POSTURE AND THAT ALL FORWARD APPROACH ZONES HAVE BEEN 
HEAVILY SATURATED WITH MINEFIELDS. 

2ND PLT HAS RECEIVED ORDERS TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 057ø 
NORTH BY NORTH-EAST. THIS WILL BRING ECHO-2 INTO CONTACT WITH ENEMY 
FIELD ARTILLERY BATTERIES AND SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE UPLINK 
EMPLACEMENTS. THE EMPLACEMENT WILL BE ECHO-2'S PRIMARY OBJECTIVE. 

FINAL MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO RIDE IN SUPPORT OF ECHO-1'S 
OPERATION AGAINST REMAINING CYPRIOT REBEL UNIT FIELD COMMAND.
